1
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:09,040
Song Huan wants land
near the springs to build a hotel.

2
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:10,760
Why is this project so important to her?

3
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:13,520
The springs are rich
in metasilicic acid.

4
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:15,760
They're great for the skin.

5
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:18,200
Win over women, and you win the market.

6
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:19,800
Song Huan wants that land

7
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:22,560
to tap into the affluent women's market.

8
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:25,120
She'll build a hotel and beauty salons.

9
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:26,720
Sounds tempting.

10
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:28,120
Now I want to go, too.

11
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:29,920
If I can get the land,

12
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:32,160
that profitable market

13
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:33,400
will be ours.

14
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:38,120
There are only a few plots

15
00:00:38,120 --> 00:00:39,320
suitable for hotels nearby.

16
00:00:39,720 --> 00:00:41,320
If I move first,

17
00:00:41,920 --> 00:00:43,560
Song Huan will be on the defensive.

18
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:45,160
I'm getting wood for Ms. Song Cheng.

19
00:00:45,160 --> 00:00:45,720
I should go.

20
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:46,520
Ms. Yu.

21
00:00:48,720 --> 00:00:49,640
Anything else?

22
00:00:50,360 --> 00:00:52,400
When I first met you,

23
00:00:52,640 --> 00:00:54,160
I noticed

24
00:00:54,160 --> 00:00:56,000
a certain youthful spark in you.

25
00:01:03,640 --> 00:01:05,040
You remind me of my first love.

26
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:23,600
This scent...

27
00:01:24,160 --> 00:01:24,960
It suits you.

28
00:01:30,180 --> 00:01:35,660
=Dear Song=

29
00:01:35,740 --> 00:01:37,620
=Episode 9=
(Undercurrents)

30
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:50,400
Such cheap perfume...

31
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:51,200
I'll toss it for you.

32
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:51,800
Hey.

33
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:53,400
Don't waste it.

34
00:01:53,600 --> 00:01:54,560
You know the drill.

35
00:01:54,560 --> 00:01:55,800
Find a place to resell it.

36
00:01:55,960 --> 00:01:57,200
Money's a good thing.

37
00:01:57,360 --> 00:01:58,600
Why throw it away?

38
00:01:59,160 --> 00:02:00,120
But I don't like him touching you.

39
00:02:02,960 --> 00:02:04,360
Then make him pay double.

40
00:02:28,920 --> 00:02:30,640
What's that smell on you?

41
00:02:30,920 --> 00:02:31,760
Isn't that

42
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:34,160
your favorite body wash?

43
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:41,520
Smells like rotten eggs to me.

44
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:46,040
Really?

45
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:48,920
Go wash again.

46
00:02:52,720 --> 00:02:53,520
Does it?

47
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:57,720
It smells nice.

48
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:09,600
Honey.

49
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:10,560
Smell me.

50
00:03:11,720 --> 00:03:13,160
I used body wash twice.

51
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:14,400
I smell great now.

52
00:03:16,320 --> 00:03:17,120
Honey...

53
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:19,360
Did I do something wrong?

54
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:23,360
I don't care

55
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:25,360
what you do at work.

56
00:03:27,720 --> 00:03:29,880
But down below,

57
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:31,840
you'd better keep it in check.

58
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:33,320
Understand?

59
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:39,520
You little rascal.

60
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:43,920
I save all my energy for you.

61
00:03:46,920 --> 00:03:47,800
Honey.

62
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:49,560
I found out something

63
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:51,120
about the hot spring project.

64
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:54,920
Song Huan's buying
nearby land for facilities.

65
00:03:56,320 --> 00:03:57,760
We have to grab it first.

66
00:03:58,720 --> 00:03:59,640
Then...

67
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:02,000
We'll build the best beauty salons.

68
00:04:03,160 --> 00:04:04,720
Find the best doctors,

69
00:04:04,720 --> 00:04:05,960
and get you injections.

70
00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:08,720
Things like that,

71
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,320
you just handle it.

72
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:13,200
Well...

73
00:04:13,760 --> 00:04:16,240
I'll take the cash from the safe.

74
00:04:20,320 --> 00:04:22,160
That depends on...

75
00:04:22,520 --> 00:04:24,760
how you perform tonight.

76
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:41,560
(Once I take over the Song family,)

77
00:04:42,080 --> 00:04:45,120
(you'll all kneel before me.)

78
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:47,320
(Especially you,)

79
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:48,960
(Song Lin.)

80
00:04:49,280 --> 00:04:51,840
(You'll lick my feet clean.)

81
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:05,160
Yu Song.

82
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:06,560
Help me grab this one.

83
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:09,040
Thanks.

84
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:36,800
Are you okay?

85
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:39,000
These are the new gloves Dad gave me.

86
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:41,600
He probably got the size wrong.

87
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:43,120
It's okay, Yu Song.

88
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:53,040
Ms. Song Huan, bad news!

89
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:56,160
Those plots we wanted

90
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:57,360
just got competing bids.

91
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:01,200
Which company is behind this?

92
00:06:01,200 --> 00:06:02,000
Did you find out?

93
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:03,640
It's Zhao Hui.

94
00:06:04,200 --> 00:06:06,000
We kept our plans for the land secret.

95
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:07,520
Zhao Hui couldn't have known.

96
00:06:07,960 --> 00:06:10,120
Did someone leak it?

97
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:11,240
(Ms. Song Huan.)

98
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:13,800
(We've picked out several plots
suitable for)

99
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:15,040
(a hot spring hotel and a beauty salon.)

100
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:26,240
Interesting.

101
00:06:35,200 --> 00:06:36,080
Ms. Song Cheng.

102
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:38,520
You've been picking for almost an hour.

103
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:39,720
Take a break.

104
00:06:39,720 --> 00:06:41,000
That'll tire your eyes out.

105
00:06:42,200 --> 00:06:43,760
I promised Mr. Yu that

106
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:45,960
when the horse ranch project launches,

107
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:48,720
I'd give him a wooden horse
I carved myself.

108
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:50,280
Yu Song.

109
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:52,120
Help me choose.

110
00:06:52,520 --> 00:06:55,200
Which piece of wood should I choose?

111
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:02,920
These woods are all precious.

112
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:06,400
But thanks to his late wife's influence,

113
00:07:06,440 --> 00:07:07,920
he's seen the finest things.

114
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:10,240
Just because it's expensive
doesn't mean it's the best.

115
00:07:11,320 --> 00:07:12,720
If it were me,

116
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:18,560
I'd choose boxwood.

117
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:22,040
Tell me why.

118
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:24,720
Boxwood may not be the priciest,

119
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:26,720
but it grows extremely slowly.

120
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,840
They say it takes
a thousand years to mature.

121
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:30,320
Wood has character, just like people.

122
00:07:30,440 --> 00:07:32,520
Slow and steady pays off
in the long run.

123
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:33,640
This also signals

124
00:07:33,640 --> 00:07:36,040
the Jinhai Chamber of Commerce
and Song Group

125
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:37,520
will enjoy a lasting partnership.

126
00:07:38,960 --> 00:07:39,440
Hmm.

127
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:44,600
Ms. Song Huan.

128
00:07:46,440 --> 00:07:47,160
Huan...

129
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:50,760
We're choosing wood for Mr. Yu.

130
00:07:51,320 --> 00:07:52,760
Come pick with us.

131
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:55,200
I'm not interested.

132
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:57,520
Besides,

133
00:07:59,400 --> 00:08:01,160
don't you already have your answer?

134
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:04,640
I'm just sharing my thoughts.

135
00:08:04,640 --> 00:08:06,160
You both know more than me.

136
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:08,600
Actually,

137
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:11,840
I have a question.

138
00:08:13,400 --> 00:08:14,920
I'd like your opinions.

139
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:16,960
If...

140
00:08:16,960 --> 00:08:18,560
I can be of help,

141
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:20,160
I'd be honored.

142
00:08:20,320 --> 00:08:21,360
Go ahead, Huan.

143
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:25,000
Tell me,

144
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:29,400
if someone tries to take what's mine,

145
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:33,160
what should I do?

146
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:37,880
I don't know much

147
00:08:37,880 --> 00:08:39,320
about business,

148
00:08:39,640 --> 00:08:40,600
but I know

149
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:42,160
you're the best, Huan.

150
00:08:42,520 --> 00:08:44,040
No one can beat you.

151
00:08:55,720 --> 00:08:56,720
Then let him have it.

152
00:08:57,160 --> 00:08:58,400
See if he can swallow it.

153
00:09:01,760 --> 00:09:03,520
Song Huan will bid higher.

154
00:09:03,920 --> 00:09:04,920
She's determined to win.

155
00:09:05,560 --> 00:09:06,720
If you want that land,

156
00:09:07,680 --> 00:09:08,960
you must raise the stakes.

157
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:11,760
Any higher and I'll have to
dip into Song Lin's savings.

158
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:13,440
If I lose the bid,

159
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:15,120
I'd be better off dead.

160
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:17,240
That's your problem, Mr. Zhao.

161
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:19,400
If you miss this chance,

162
00:09:19,520 --> 00:09:20,400
I can't promise

163
00:09:20,400 --> 00:09:22,160
you'll get another opening this good.

164
00:09:26,400 --> 00:09:27,440
Not enough cash.

165
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:29,320
I need to sell some stock.

166
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:30,640
Give me some time.

167
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:32,000
Make it quick.

168
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:00,040
Yu Song.

169
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,800
Sooner or later,

170
00:10:03,040 --> 00:10:05,440
you'll willingly get into my bed.

171
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:18,320
Ms. Song Lin.

172
00:10:19,280 --> 00:10:20,320
You see that?

173
00:10:21,560 --> 00:10:22,320
I told you,

174
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:24,400
all my photos were real.

175
00:10:24,920 --> 00:10:26,960
Now that you've seen it,
do you believe me?

176
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:28,160
Yu Song is

177
00:10:28,160 --> 00:10:30,040
a troublemaking little homewrecker.

178
00:10:30,040 --> 00:10:30,440
Shut up!

179
00:10:32,440 --> 00:10:33,440
You two are shameless!

180
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:36,120
Do you think I'm blind?

181
00:10:44,160 --> 00:10:44,960
Perfect.

182
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:48,320
Dad's meeting reporters
the day after tomorrow.

183
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:50,440
They're interviewing
that illegitimate daughter.

184
00:10:51,800 --> 00:10:53,280
When that happens,

185
00:10:53,280 --> 00:10:56,600
I'll take back everything I've lost.

186
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:00,880
Song.

187
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:02,720
What's your plan, exactly?

188
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:04,360
You decided to split

189
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:05,920
the profits from the hot spring project
with Zhao Hui.

190
00:11:06,640 --> 00:11:08,160
So why are you planning to
side with Song Huan?

191
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:10,720
Zhao Hui isn't worthy
of working with me.

192
00:11:11,160 --> 00:11:14,360
He's just my way of proving
my loyalty to Song Huan.

193
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:16,520
And I've looked into it.

194
00:11:17,040 --> 00:11:19,960
The plots Song Huan plans to develop
all have problems.

195
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:22,040
She probably set the trap long ago,

196
00:11:22,040 --> 00:11:23,520
waiting for Zhao Hui to walk into it.

197
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:24,920
When that happens,

198
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:28,120
Song Lin could lose everything.

199
00:11:28,400 --> 00:11:29,360
Right.

200
00:11:29,360 --> 00:11:31,600
Song Huan's plan to pull the rug out

201
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:33,160
from under Song Lin is brilliant.

202
00:11:33,560 --> 00:11:34,640
From the sound of it,

203
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:36,640
you actually admire Song Huan.

204
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:38,760
I've always admired her.

205
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:42,560
If Song Huan were a son,

206
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:45,720
Song Huaishan would've given her
the company long ago.

207
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:49,000
Favoring sons over daughters.

208
00:11:49,520 --> 00:11:50,440
So what if

209
00:11:51,160 --> 00:11:53,160
Song Huan reaches out to you?

210
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:55,040
Would you abandon Song Cheng?

211
00:11:58,760 --> 00:11:59,760
She's already reached out to me.

212
00:12:01,640 --> 00:12:02,720
I support Song Cheng

213
00:12:02,720 --> 00:12:05,320
because she's the most overlooked Song.

214
00:12:06,960 --> 00:12:09,560
If something ever happens to me,

215
00:12:09,880 --> 00:12:11,400
given her current situation,

216
00:12:11,400 --> 00:12:13,040
she might not be able to protect me.

217
00:12:14,360 --> 00:12:17,080
Song Huaishan arranged an interview
for Song Cheng tomorrow.

218
00:12:17,280 --> 00:12:18,360
It's a good chance.

219
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:20,280
I'd better get ready.

220
00:12:21,380 --> 00:12:23,500
(Lighting Future)

221
00:12:25,300 --> 00:12:28,300
(GangA 66688)

222
00:12:36,280 --> 00:12:37,120
Ms. Song Cheng.

223
00:12:37,640 --> 00:12:40,240
Today's your first public interview.

224
00:12:41,640 --> 00:12:43,160
It's also my first time

225
00:12:43,160 --> 00:12:44,960
coming here for work.

226
00:12:46,880 --> 00:12:48,040
Thanks, Yu Song.

227
00:13:06,040 --> 00:13:06,840
Song Group

228
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:09,440
is one of Nigang's
most low-key companies.

229
00:13:09,760 --> 00:13:10,520
I never knew

230
00:13:10,520 --> 00:13:13,240
Mr. Song's youngest daughter
is a wood artist.

231
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:16,560
I wouldn't call myself a wood artist.

232
00:13:16,760 --> 00:13:19,240
I've just loved woodwork
since I was little.

233
00:13:19,520 --> 00:13:20,400
I think every piece of wood...

234
00:13:20,400 --> 00:13:21,280
Yu Song.

235
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:23,440
Get me a bottle of champagne.

236
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:24,800
I want to toast my little sister.

237
00:13:24,800 --> 00:13:27,160
Just as Dad taught me,

238
00:13:27,440 --> 00:13:30,640
we should stay humble and practical.

239
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:33,840
Mr. Song clearly raised you well.

240
00:13:34,840 --> 00:13:35,560
Cheng...

241
00:13:35,560 --> 00:13:36,480
She's

242
00:13:36,640 --> 00:13:37,720
always been sensible.

243
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:39,480
I never worry about her.

244
00:13:39,480 --> 00:13:40,640
I'm planning...

245
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:42,360
Ms. Zhang,

246
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:44,720
I think there's another story

247
00:13:45,040 --> 00:13:46,800
worth covering.

248
00:13:48,640 --> 00:13:50,680
Got an exclusive, Ms. Song Lin?

249
00:13:51,240 --> 00:13:52,080
Of course.

250
00:13:54,920 --> 00:13:56,480
A rich family's dirty secret.

251
00:13:56,960 --> 00:13:58,640
Guaranteed exclusive.

252
00:14:08,520 --> 00:14:09,680
You're just a maid!

253
00:14:10,040 --> 00:14:11,720
How dare you seduce my husband?
